resources.string:
Before you start, please take a minute to read the user agreement and privacy policy to learn how we protect your personal information:

· We only collect your phone number and device information with your consent, for sign-in and notifications;
· Chat images and files are stored encrypted and only conversation members can access them;
· You can view, correct or delete your personal information at any time;
· We never share your information with third parties without your permission.
